        <content type="html" xml:base="https://cncsmonster.github.io/en/posts/shi-yong-uv-guan-li-python-bao/">&lt;p&gt;UV is a blazing-fast Python package and project manager written in Rust.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;reference&quot;&gt;Reference&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;astral-sh&#x2F;uv&quot;&gt;astral-sh&#x2F;uv&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;installation&quot;&gt;Installation&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;bash&quot; class=&quot;language-bash &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Using pip
pip install uv

# Or using the standalone installer
curl -LsSf https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;astral.sh&amp;#x2F;uv&amp;#x2F;install.sh | sh

# Or using cargo
cargo install uv
&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;using-uv-to-run-python-projects&quot;&gt;Using UV to Run Python Projects&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;bash&quot; class=&quot;language-bash &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Navigate to the project root first
# Initialize UV project configuration
uv init

# Add dependencies
uv add &amp;lt;package-name&amp;gt;

# Run a Python script
uv run python script.py

# Run arbitrary commands
uv run &amp;lt;command&amp;gt;
&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;common-commands&quot;&gt;Common Commands&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;bash&quot; class=&quot;language-bash &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Create a virtual environment
uv venv

# Install packages
uv pip install &amp;lt;package&amp;gt;

# Export dependencies
uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt

# Sync dependencies
uv pip sync requirements.txt

# Show dependency tree
uv pip tree
&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;advantages&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Blazing fast&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: 10–100× faster than pip&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;strong&gt;Compatible&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Fully compatible with pip and requirements.txt&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;All-in-one&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Combines venv, pip, and pip-tools functionality&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🦀 &lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Built with Rust — stable and reliable&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
</content>
        
